CCOONNTTRROOLL MMEESSSSAAGGEESS
     This node type supports the generic control messages, plus the following:

     NGM_CISCO_SET_IPADDR (sseettiippaaddddrr)
          This command takes an array of two struct in_addr arguments.  The
          first is the IP address of the corresponding interface and the sec‐
          ond is the netmask.

     NGM_CISCO_GET_IPADDR (ggeettiippaaddddrr)
          This command returns the IP configuration in the same format used by
          NGM_CISCO_SET_IPADDR.  This command is also _s_e_n_t by this node type
          to the inet peer whenever an IP address inquiry packet is received.

     NGM_CISCO_GET_STATUS (ggeettssttaattss)
          Returns a struct ngciscostat:

              struct ngciscostat {
                uint32_t   seqRetries;        /* # unack'd retries */
                uint32_t   keepAlivePeriod;   /* in seconds */
              };

SSHHUUTTDDOOWWNN
     This node shuts down upon receipt of a NGM_SHUTDOWN control message, or
     when all hooks have been disconnected.

